### 11. Audit log implementation
- Function: `record(orgId, action, input)` in `src/server/services/activity-service.ts` (full above), backed by `activityRepo.insertActivity(...)`.
- `ActivityAction` union is defined in `src/types/activity.ts` (full above) and is closed — currently: `organization.updated | project.* | issue.* | comment.* | member.invited | member.joined | member.role_changed | member.removed | billing.plan_changed | flag.toggled`. **You must add a new action** (e.g. `"organization.ownership_transferred"`) to this union to record handover completion.
